      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Identifying Who Was Added to the Team"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Group Member Added showed Admin at 17:52:40. Affected Data identified Orders Lab - Analysts and Demo Analyst."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The record identified the added person, not merely that the group changed. Membership history can explain changes even as users grow or operators change."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
